      "text": {
        "jp": "ワシらは不老不死じゃからな。\r\n姉さんもここから落ちたぐらいでは死なんわい。",
        "official_en": "We are immortal, remember. ’Twill take more than a tumble to kill her.",
        "real_en": "We're immortal, after all. Even my sister wouldn't die from a fall from here."
